WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
Some things I've built.

2
00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:03.250
Some I've led.

3
00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:04.870
At The Possible Zone,

4
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.760
a workforce-development organization

5
00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:09.590
and youth business
incubator in Boston,

6
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.910
I was Chief Innovation Officer.

7
00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:15.590
I led technology,
product, and AI strategy.

8
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:16.720
NeuRace.

9
00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.260
I built the sensor
hardware and the software,

10
00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:23.190
then ran it as a service with
professional Grand Prix teams.

11
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:27.550
The driver's brain and body signals,
next to the car's telemetry,

12
00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.830
so a team could see how a
driver responded on track.

13
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.410
BrightStory is a startup I co-founded.

14
00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:37.440
It makes personalized visual stories
that help neurodivergent kids,

15
00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:40.950
and their families, get ready
for something unfamiliar.

16
00:00:41.460 --> 00:00:45.310
Bravely is close to that, for children
with cancer and their families.

17
00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.810
It helps them understand
what to expect.

18
00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.060
ZoneSight looks for
behavioral evidence

19
00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.250
of skills that are hard to measure.

20
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:56.150
We published it at
IEEE EDUCON in 2025.

21
00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:57.540
And Safar.

22
00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:00.460
Interactive stories for
workplace learning teams,

23
00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:04.570
so people practice hard decisions,
instead of just reading about them.

24
00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:08.390
If you've got something that needs
building, reach out through the site.
